<title>NETHERLANDS: RABO SECURITIES RAISES SPHINX TO A HOLD.</title>
<headline>RABO SECURITIES RAISES SPHINX TO A HOLD.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of March research.</p>
<p>Company-------------Sector---------Price---Broker------</p>
<p>Sphinx Gustavsberg  sanitary ware  20.00   Rabo Securities</p>
<p>COMMENT: Hold (upgraded from Sell)</p>
<p>Very disappointing 1996/97 first half results. We think</p>
<p>shares should trade at large discount to market but we think</p>
<p>that the downside risk is relatively limited. Given increasing</p>
<p>chances for improvement in stock price, we no longer advise to</p>
<p>sell the shares and have upgraded our recommendation.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS    P/E    P/CF   Dividend</p>
<p>    1996/97	     0.40   50.0   4.0    0.14</p>
<p>    1997/98	     1.30   15.4   3.6    0.45</p>
<p>    1998/99	     2.25    8.9   3.1    0.79</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
